## 4. Auto-update pipeline (CORE MAGIC)

Add this step after dataset generation:

```python
def update_skill_taxonomy(texts):
    extracted_terms = extract_candidates(texts)

    for term in extracted_terms:
        normalized = normalize(term)

        if normalized not in taxonomy:
            taxonomy[normalized] = [term]
        else:
            if term not in taxonomy[normalized]:
                taxonomy[normalized].append(term)
```

---

## 5. Candidate extraction (simple version)

Use:

* regex
* n-grams
* frequency

```python
def extract_candidates(text):
    words = re.findall(r'\b[a-zA-Z0-9\+\#\.]+\b', text.lower())
    return [w for w in words if len(w) > 2]
```

---

## 6. Normalize (VERY IMPORTANT)

```python
def normalize(skill):
    return skill.lower().replace(".", "").replace("-", "").strip()
```

---

